  "html": "<p class=\"\">Production and technical work for <a href=\"https://longlead.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://longlead.com\">Long Lead</a>, a story studio that builds each long-form feature from scratch — no CMS, no templates.</p>\n<h2 class=\"\" id=\"the-depths-shell-reach\">The Depths She'll Reach</h2>\n<p class=\"\">Xan Rice's profile of world-record freediver Alenka Artnik, told as an immersive scroll that mirrors the descent. It won two Webbys for Best Sports Website.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The Depths She&#x27;ll Reach — a freediver descending, with captioned audio\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1666630397/project-images/ll_diver.png\" alt=\"The Depths She&#x27;ll Reach — a freediver descending, with captioned audio\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/v1666630397/project-images/ll_diver.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/v1666630397/project-images/ll_diver.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1666630397/project-images/ll_diver.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/v1666630397/project-images/ll_diver.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"The Depths She&#x27;ll Reach — a freediver descending, with captioned audio\" width=\"5000\" height=\"2625\" style=\"--splay-rot:-2.93deg;\" data-dimensions=\"5000×2625\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The Depths She'll Reach — a freediver descending, with captioned audio</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"\"><a href=\"https://thedepths.longlead.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://thedepths.longlead.com/\">Read the story →</a></p>\n<h2 class=\"\" id=\"querdenken-covid-misinformation-or-freedom-movement\">Querdenken: COVID Misinformation or Freedom Movement?</h2>\n<p class=\"\">Darren Loucaides' investigation into Germany's Querdenken movement and the 2020 storming of the Reichstag. I'm credited for production and technical support. The data graphics trace the audience growth of the Querdenken_711 and Qlobal Change Telegram channels (data: Telemetrio) and map the Telegram universe around Querdenken_711 (network data: Jordan Wildon / Logically).</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The Rise of Qlobal Change &#x26; Querdenken_711 — audience growth beside the Telegram network map\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1666630397/project-images/ll_querdenken.png\" alt=\"The Rise of Qlobal Change &#x26; Querdenken_711 — audience growth beside the Telegram network map\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/v1666630397/project-images/ll_querdenken.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/v1666630397/project-images/ll_querdenken.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1666630397/project-images/ll_querdenken.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/v1666630397/project-images/ll_querdenken.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"The Rise of Qlobal Change &#x26; Querdenken_711 — audience growth beside the Telegram network map\" width=\"5001\" height=\"2625\" style=\"--splay-rot:1.24deg;\" data-dimensions=\"5001×2625\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The Rise of Qlobal Change &#x26; Querdenken_711 — audience growth beside the Telegram network map</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"\"><a href=\"https://querdenken.longlead.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://querdenken.longlead.com/\">Read the story →</a></p>",
